{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/Welcome_to.png?t=1744979454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Hermit Kingdom, an isolated country under brutal hardship. Here, you must use their secure computer operating system and gather intel on the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Hermit Computer</i></strong> is a horror-puzzle game set deep within a secretive hermit kingdom. You play as an American operative, captured while covertly gathering intel on the government. Now imprisoned in a high-security facility, your only tool is a restricted, state-run computer system. Use it to uncover secrets, navigate censored networks, and reach out to the U.S. Embassy\u2014all while avoiding detection by patrolling guards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There are ears everywhere.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/2025-04-0905-22-43_1-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1744979454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Careful not to be too loud-- there are ears everywhere in the Hermit Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather intel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/2025-04-0905-22-43_3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744979454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and take pictures of all the secrets found on the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crack the puzzle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/2025-04-0905-22-43_4-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1744979454\" /></p><p class=